    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32220" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκομ-ῐδή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>removal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.44
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.655.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>purgation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν περιττωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.176
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				2.103
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a corpse,
				<i>burial,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πολυτελής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.92
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(7).395.27
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.34.5
			</span></i> (Olbia, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>).</div>
